    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet — Cordon Combat Chirurgeon.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>cordon-combat-chirurgeon</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 2 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with DEX); AC 15 (reinforced leather &amp; steel harness), hit points 39 (6d8+12), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Iron Legion chirurgeons approach wounded soldiers the way engineers approach broken siege engines: stabilize the mechanism, inject adrenaline stims, and push it back into the breach.</p><p>Equipped with the dreaded Iron Legion Field Syringe rigs, their chemical cocktails keep frontlines fighting long past standard endurance.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> combat medic · <strong>tier:</strong> Syringe Corps · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Frontline Patrol.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/iron-legion/cordon-combat-chirurgeon.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 510005, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A battle surgeon wearing a heavy leather apron over a dark grey uniform, a copper plague-style respirator mask, and a back-mounted brass chemical tank connected by rubber tubes to a massive pneumatic brass injection syringe in one hand. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
